  "estimatedLength": "35 minutes",
  "objectives": [
    "Represent a two-dimensional vector by magnitude and direction and equivalently by horizontal and vertical components.",
    "Add vectors graphically using the tip-to-tail method and identify the resultant vector.",
    "Decompose a vector into x- and y-components using right-triangle trigonometry and reconstruct the original vector from its components.",
    "Explain the independence of horizontal and vertical projectile motion when gravity acts only vertically.",
    "Describe how horizontal velocity, vertical velocity, and position change during projectile flight, including the zero vertical velocity at maximum height.",
    "Predict how launch angle and launch speed affect projectile trajectory, range, and maximum height."
